OL,3,GNEWSAAppeal after officer attacked at
OL,4,Afast food restaurant
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are appealing for information
OL,7,Fafter an officer was assaulted by an
OL,8,Fe-bike rider at a McDonalds in Long
OL,9,FEaton.
OL,11,FThe officer had gone to the fast food
OL,12,Fvenue in Waverley Street to investigate
OL,13,Fa group of "nuisance antisocial e-bikes
OL,14,Fand mopeds" on Wednesday at about
OL,15,F20:15, Derbyshire Police said.
OL,17,FWhile a young male on an e-bike was
OL,18,Fbeing detained, he assaulted the
OL,19,Fofficer before fleeing, leaving behind
OL,20,Fthe bike, his mobile phone and one of
OL,21,Fhis trainers.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
